  <entry>
    <title>个人博客搭建</title>
    <link href="https://lisj03.github.io/2025/10/05/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/"/>
    <id>https://lisj03.github.io/2025/10/05/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/</id>
    <published>2025-10-04T19:48:12.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-10-04T19:54:27.208Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h4 id="安装基本环境"><a href="#安装基本环境" class="headerlink" title="安装基本环境"></a>安装基本环境</h4><ol><li><strong>Node.js + npm</strong>（JavaScript 运行环境）</li><li><strong>Git</strong></li><li><strong>GitHub 账号</strong></li></ol><h4 id="安装-Hexo"><a href="#安装-Hexo" class="headerlink" title="安装 Hexo"></a><strong>安装 Hexo</strong></h4><ol><li><p>安装 Hexo CLI</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>创建一个博客文件夹（myblog）</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">mkdir</span> myblog</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> myblog</span><br><span class="line">hexo init</span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>打开浏览器输入：<a href="http://localhost:4000/" title="http:&#x2F;&#x2F;localhost:4000">http://localhost:4000</a>，能看到初始页面</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ol><h4 id="选择并更换自己喜欢的主题"><a href="#选择并更换自己喜欢的主题" class="headerlink" title="选择并更换自己喜欢的主题"></a>选择并更换自己喜欢的主题</h4><ul><li>网址： <a href="https://hexo.io/themes/" title="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;hexo.io&#x2F;themes&#x2F;">https://hexo.io/themes/</a></li></ul><ol><li><p>安装主题</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cd themes</span><br><span class="line">git clone https://github.com/theme-next/hexo-theme-next next</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>修改配置文件_config.yml</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> ..</span><br><span class="line">vim _config.yml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>修改theme: 行为</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">next（选择的主题名称）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ol><h4 id="wolai导出文档"><a href="#wolai导出文档" class="headerlink" title="wolai导出文档"></a>wolai导出文档</h4><h4 id="移动-Markdown-文件到-Hexo-项目根目录下的source-post文件夹"><a href="#移动-Markdown-文件到-Hexo-项目根目录下的source-post文件夹" class="headerlink" title="移动 Markdown 文件到 Hexo 项目根目录下的source&#x2F;_post文件夹"></a><strong>移动 Markdown 文件到 Hexo 项目根目录下的source&#x2F;_post文件夹</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Hexo 项目根目录</strong>：～&#x2F;myblog</li></ul><h4 id="添加-front-matter-头部信息"><a href="#添加-front-matter-头部信息" class="headerlink" title="添加 front-matter 头部信息"></a><strong>添加 front-matter 头部信息</strong></h4><ul><li>在最上方加上这样的内容<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">我的第一篇博客文章</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">date:</span> <span class="number">2025-09-04 21:00:00</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">tags:</span> [<span class="string">Wolai</span>, <span class="string">笔记</span>]</span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">categories:</span> <span class="string">生活记录</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><h4 id="处理wolai导出的图片"><a href="#处理wolai导出的图片" class="headerlink" title="处理wolai导出的图片"></a>处理wolai导出的图片</h4><ul><li>把所有图片移动到 source&#x2F;images&#x2F;和博客titile同名的文件夹下</li><li>修改 Markdown 中图片路径：<figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![](<span class="link">/images/[title]/image-1.png</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><h4 id="运行"><a href="#运行" class="headerlink" title="运行"></a>运行</h4><ol><li><p>cd到博客路径</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> ~/myblog</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>运行</p><figure class="highlight typescript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/image/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/%E6%88%AA%E5%B1%8F2025-10-04%2021.22.16_USItI-fEvG.png"></p></li><li><p>打开浏览器输入：<a href="http://localhost:4000/" title="http:&#x2F;&#x2F;localhost:4000">http://localhost:4000</a>，能看到初始页面</p></li></ol>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
    <summary type="html">&lt;h4 id=&quot;安装基本环境&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#安装基本环境&quot; class=&quot;headerlink&quot; title=&quot;安装基本环境&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;安装基本环境&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Node.js + npm&lt;/strong&gt;（JavaScript 运行环境）&lt;</summary>
      
    
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  <entry>
    <title>copilot agent 的vscode 配置</title>
    <link href="https://lisj03.github.io/2025/09/17/copilot%20agent%20%E7%9A%84vscode%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/"/>
    <id>https://lisj03.github.io/2025/09/17/copilot%20agent%20%E7%9A%84vscode%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</id>
    <published>2025-09-17T00:31:56.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-10-04T21:42:44.004Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="设置maxrequests"><a href="#设置maxrequests" class="headerlink" title="设置maxrequests"></a>设置maxrequests</h3><ul><li><p>设置里搜索copilot</p><p><img src="/image/copilot%20agent%20%E7%9A%84vscode%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/%E6%88%AA%E5%B1%8F2025-09-15%2010.26.09_MyfAWQnNkg.png"></p></li><li><p>打开settings.json</p><p>添加3行内容</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">&quot;chat.agent.maxRequests&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="number">100</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">&quot;chat.todoListTool.enabled&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">&quot;chat.tools.autoApprove&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/image/copilot%20agent%20%E7%9A%84vscode%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/%E6%88%AA%E5%B1%8F2025-09-15%2010.27.51_jH5nHYgLSN.png"></p></li></ul><h3 id="允许命令行运行命令"><a href="#允许命令行运行命令" class="headerlink" title="允许命令行运行命令"></a>允许命令行运行命令</h3><ul><li>comm +  ，</li><li>编辑settings.json文件<figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">&quot;chat.tools.terminal.autoApprove&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;mkdir&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;npm run build&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;^git (status|show\\b.*)$&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;^/Get-ChildItem\\b.*&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;ls&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;pwd&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;cd&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;rmdir&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;chmod&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;kill&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;head&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;bash&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;tail&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;conda&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;python&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;pip&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;grep&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;./*&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;rm&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">false</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;del&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">false</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;curl&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">false</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;wget&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">false</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;eval&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">false</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;chown&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">false</span></span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">&quot;/^Remove-Item\\b/i&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">false</span></span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><h3 id="Debug-Log"><a href="#Debug-Log" class="headerlink" title="Debug Log"></a>Debug Log</h3><p><img src="/image/copilot%20agent%20%E7%9A%84vscode%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/%E6%88%AA%E5%B1%8F2025-09-17%2014.15.22_YKNQInNqm9.png"></p>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
